8</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2105-6-44</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tringe</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Wagner</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruby</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enriching for direct regulatory targets in perturbed gene-expression profiles.</article-title><source>Genome Biol</source><year>2004</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>R29</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15059262</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/gb-2004-5-4-r29</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansen</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Mooren</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Post</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hug</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Zuse</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Los</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methods and biomarkers for the diagnosis and prognosis of cancer and other diseases: towards personalized medicine.</article-title><source>Drug Resist Updat</source><year>2006</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>198</fpage><lpage>210</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17011811</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.drup.2006.08.001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>He</surname><given-names>YD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genomic approach to biomarker identification and its recent applications.</article-title><source>Cancer Biomark</source><year>2006</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>133</lpag